Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.24,0:22:12.09,Name,Sign,0001,0436,0051,,{\fad(798,1)}Kurashina Asuka
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.24,0:22:12.09,School,Sign,0318,0001,0127,,{\an2}{\fad(798,1)}Kairyou Academy 2nd Year
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.24,0:22:12.09,Name,Sign,0494,0001,0156,,{\an2}{\fad(798,1)}Inui Saki
