Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.46,0:23:46.53,Preview,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(673,1)}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.53,0:23:47.23,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.23,0:23:48.19,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Just a bit more...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.19,0:23:52.03,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,It is time for silence to descend upon us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.03,0:23:54.29,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Let's keep flying together!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.05,0:23:55.45,Episode-Title - End,Title,0000,0000,0000,,Episode Twelve:\N "Let's... Keep Flying!!"
